    points: [
      {
        title: "Efficient",
        copy: "Our synchronization model is by far more light-weight in terms of RAM usage, computational effort and required network bandwidth as no hashes need to be looked up, indexed or transmitted over the network.",
        icon: Sync.src,
      },
      {
        title: "Fast",
        copy: "The protocol supports addressing block ranges by height ranges which allows batch downloads of blocks without any list of hashes to be transmitted or processed. This greatly optimizes and speeds up synchronization.",
        icon: Sync.src,
